        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Reilly, Jeff Turzo, Sean Beavan\n- Organizations: God Lives Underwater, The Dear Hunter\n- Places: Perkiomenville, Pennsylvania, Philadelphia, Providence, Rhode Island\n- Topics: industrial rock, progressive rock, music production, audio engineering\n\nFacts:\n- In 1993, David Reilly and Jeff Turzo formed God Lives Underwater in rural Perkiomenville, Pennsylvania, near Philadelphia.\n- God Lives Underwater was an industrial rock band.\n- The Dear Hunter is an American progressive rock band from Providence, Rhode Island.\n- Sean Beavan is a musician, record producer, and audio engineer.\n- Sean Beavan is best known for his work with Nine Inch Nails, Marilyn Manson, Guns N' Roses, God Lives Underwater, and Slayer.",
